# Agent and tooling scratch output. These land in the working tree during
# normal work and are never part of a change: graphify's knowledge-graph
# cache, the review loop's summary, and the PLAN-* scratch notes used while
# scoping work. Ignored so `git status` stays a signal about the change in
# progress rather than a list of artifacts to mentally filter out.
graphify-out/
agent-review-summary.md
agent-code-review.md
PLAN-*
